# GitHub Package Registry configuration
# Copy this file to .npmrc and replace the token placeholder

# For consuming projects (installing the package):
@ampeco:registry=https://npm.pkg.github.com
//npm.pkg.github.com/:_authToken=YOUR_GITHUB_TOKEN

# Instructions:
# 1. Copy this file: cp .npmrc.example .npmrc
# 2. Replace YOUR_GITHUB_TOKEN with your GitHub Personal Access Token
#    OR use environment variable: //npm.pkg.github.com/:_authToken=${NODE_AUTH_TOKEN}
# 3. Token needs 'read:packages' scope to install, 'write:packages' to publish
# 
# Generate token at: https://github.com/settings/tokens
#
# For environment variable approach (recommended for CI/CD):
# - Set NODE_AUTH_TOKEN environment variable
# - Windows: $env:NODE_AUTH_TOKEN="your_token"
# - Linux/Mac: export NODE_AUTH_TOKEN="your_token"

